    "## Visualize raw k-space data\n",
    "Inspect and visualize the raw k-space dataset using the [ismrmrd-python](https://github.com/ismrmrd/ismrmrd-python) library.  Data from multiple scans/acquisitions can be stored in a single file, grouped in ['datasets'](https://ismrmrd.readthedocs.io/en/latest/mrd_files.html#mrd-file-format).  The datasets in a file can be listed with:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "File \"data/MiniFLASH_Fire.mrd\" contains 1 datasets:\n",
      "  dataset\n",
      "Reading dataset \"dataset\" from file \"data/MiniFLASH_Fire.mrd\"\n",
      "There are 128 imaging readouts out of a total of 128 readouts\n",
      "Loop index counters with unique values:\n",
      "  kspace_encode_step_1 has 128 unique values (min:   0, max: 127)\n",
      "Readouts with AcquisitionHeader flags present:\n",
      "[  0] Lin 0: ACQ_FIRST_IN_SLICE\n",
      "[127] Lin 127: ACQ_LAST_IN_MEASUREMENT, ACQ_LAST_IN_REPETITION, ACQ_LAST_IN_SLICE\n"
     ]
